      "sourceTextSha256": "4f226adfd81701df8866ea4e0d779c4f20ac4d2862567e75ac09c3017131f9cb",
      "text": "Day 2 · Wake up to the songs of countless bird species for another day in the Pantanal. The lodge offers a variety of shared excursions, each a new opportunity to discover this remarkable ecosystem: observe animals in their natural habitat, admire spectacular scenery and learn about the traditions and conservation efforts that help preserve this extraordinary environment. Every moment here is an invitation to slow down and connect with nature.",
